FFF]vcs_backed_artifact_capture.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-b7[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-b7/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust core: VCS-backed records and on-demand materialization[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-record[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-record: add the three VCS-provenance fields and an optional stored [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path to the artifact-file wire, admit byte-free rows, resolve them to a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]new `vcs_backed` status, and add a content-verified git materialization [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]primitive exposed through `sase_core_rs`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Capture policy — the authorship and version-control decision[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]capture-policy[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-policy: add a pure decision module that classifies every capture[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]candidate as store, reference, or skip using a git probe, the repo [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inventory, the run window, and a per-run byte-copy cap, plus its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]configuration.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Python record, doctor, and read surfaces[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]py-record[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-record[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]py-record: mirror the new record fields in Python, make ids and dedupe [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]keys work without a stored path, teach doctor that byte-free rows are [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]healthy, and make every read surface materialize VCS-backed content on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]demand.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Wire the policy into finalization capture[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]capture-wiring[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture-policy, py-record[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-wiring: label capture candidates with their origin, route them [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through the policy at finalization, write reference rows instead of byte[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]copies, enforce the cap, and cover the decision matrix end to end.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Docs, skill, and configuration reference[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs-and-skill[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture-wiring[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs-and-skill: document VCS-backed artifact files in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`sase_artifact_file` skill source, the artifact docs, and the new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]configuration block, and regenerate the deployed skill.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-b7","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-b7.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-26294ffc2db5618cd208ba1e9dde3bac","started_at":"2026-07-30T12:54:41.037122+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"553ed888d3681649f508a30f1870041cd604712d358b9b6a8efe88e2f632e7d9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-b7.4.w3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"2c59e8eb5dcf4e70f7e99f6df01dcd78832666b816cb0c0ce1979564c53c1207","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-b7.4.w3/meta.json","size_bytes":430},"prompt":{"digest":"2b4e05f9a61b7c24d9c6d04fb03b7de4518dca147439